{#ff4fd8}{b}THIS EXAMPLE PAGE OPENS AUTOMATICALLY.
AFTER TESTING IT, SET "enabled": false BEFORE ENABLING AUTO-OPEN ON ANOTHER PAGE.{/}{/}

Available modes are once, always and dismissible. An empty worlds list makes the page eligible in every world/instance. Increase version when you want players to receive the automatic page again.

Create a ready-to-edit page with {#54daf4}/infopages newpage <name> <command>{/}. After editing JSON, use {#54daf4}/infopages reload{/} to apply valid page, command and auto-open changes without restarting the server.

{#ffd54a}{b}IMPORTANT
AFTER CREATING A NEW PAGE COMMAND, RESTART THE SERVER BEFORE NORMAL/NON-OP PLAYERS CAN USE THAT COMMAND.{/}{/}

Put local PNG files in mods/MenuInfoPages/images/ and reference them simply as logo.png (or images/logo.png). Existing UI asset paths and direct HTTP/HTTPS PNG URLs still work. External images are never resized; live image reload is controlled by reload.yml.

{#ffd54a}{b}IMPORTANT
USE PNG IMAGES ONLY, PREFERABLY UNDER 2 MB.{/}{/}
